<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Morris (2012), Mooi & David (1998) & Meinhardt (2008) echinoderm bilateral-to-pentaradial hydrocoel ring symmetry breaking & Lovén's Law (Strongylocentrotus purpuratus & Tripneustes gratilla (Echinoidea crown-group echinoderms))",
        "Morris (2012), Mooi & David (1998) & Meinhardt (2008) echinoderm bilateral-to-pentaradial hydrocoel ring symmetry breaking & Lovén's Law faithfully reproduces Strongylocentrotus purpuratus & Tripneustes gratilla (Echinoidea crown-group echinoderms) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2005-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Strongylocentrotus purpuratus & Tripneustes gratilla (Echinoidea crown-group echinoderms) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 51.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2005-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry.py> ;
    schema:about "Strongylocentrotus purpuratus & Tripneustes gratilla (Echinoidea crown-group echinoderms)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/HEAD/2005-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry.py; output: docs/media/echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry_comparison.png; organism: Strongylocentrotus purpuratus & Tripneustes gratilla (Echinoidea crown-group echinoderms); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: f94f62955d7ff6974c8a237ced577144db975e6e7e74430aca24de11b763608f; artifact_sha256: 28b98789b0b6280378531cfa4ba7608dd7f541e0956961716449cc8b8db7022f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry/echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry_reference.json=c516e298727883cf..., datasets/echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry/echinoderm_pentaradial_test_specimen.jpg=953b2f7e38029627..., datasets/echinoderm_pentaradial_symmetry/scout_manifest.json=0b333ebe2a2ed524...}" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0070-2153(07)81001-5>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2005.05.008>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1093/icb/38.6.965>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1525-142X.2012.00552.x>,
        <https://doi.org/10.5962/bhl.title.46385> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-code-traceability>,
