<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Morris (2012), Mooi & David (1998) & Meinhardt (2008) echinoderm bilateral-to-pentaradial hydrocoel ring symmetry breaking & Lovén's Law — Model fidelity to source: 54/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates a static algebraic dispersion curve sigma(m) and analytic cosine ring envelope to illustrate m* = 5, but omits time-stepping the Gierer-Meinhardt activator-inhibitor PDE during hydrocoel crescent-to-ring closure, omits Lovén's Law (II, IV, I, III, V) sequential initiation, and omits Duboc et al. (2005) Nodal left-right twin-rudiment (2x5) symmetry breaking." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
